 dragons… in your very own garden!\n\nWhen Tomas discovers a strange old tree at the bottom of his grandad's garden, he doesn't think much of it. But he takes the funny fruit from the tree back into the house – and gets the shock and delight of his life when a tiny dragon hatches! The tree is a dragonfruit tree, and Tomas has got his very own dragon, Flicker...\n\nTomas soon finds out that life with Flicker is great fun, but also very… unpredictable. Yes, dragons are wonderful, but they also set fire to your toothbrush and leave your pants hanging from the TV aerial. Tomas has to learn how to look after Flicker – and quickly. And then something extraordinary happens – more dragonfruits appear on the tree. Tomas is officially growing dragons…","category":"stories","author":"Andy Shepherd","previewAudio":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0051/8845/2401/files/andy-shepherd-the-boy-who-flew-with-dragons.mp3","abridged":false,"accent":"UK English","audioPreviewUrl":"https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/audio-previews/c2ac1595563a9857899a22457c1b13c0c963f359d4e88e8fb99f3d76def24d80/CHTRf8-rGA3Dn7IjL8MabANk4GORynxBuGit2Acj8mc.mp3","copyright":"℗ Bonnier Books UK; Cover artwork © Sara Ogilvie","maxAge":11,"minAge":6,"cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/nLEFq-tP2KAZoEDJi9CLPWyao3fZrjoWRoom3Ulmm4k"},"status":{"name":"live","updatedAt":"2020-11-19T11:32:11.193Z"},"languages":["en"],"media":{"duration":13290,"fileSize":111186200,"hasStreams":false},"accents":["UK English"],"authors":["Andy Shepherd"],"copyrights":["℗ Bonnier Books UK","Cover artwork © Sara Ogilvie"],"genres":["fantasy","animal-stories"],"narrators":["Ewan Goddard"]},"slug":"andy-shepherd-the-boy-who-flew-with-dragons","title":"The Boy Who Flew with Dragons","updatedAt":"2021-01-26T10:32:45.724Z","userId":"yoto","sortkey":"andy-shepherd-the-boy-who-flew-with-dragons"},"ownership":{"canAccess":true,"userHasRole":false,"cardIsFree":false,"cardIsMadeByUser":false,"cardIsInFamilyLi